<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:8a83c6f1-5852-45b3-8852-d4ae2de240f0">
              <SHORT-NAME>CanNm</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration Parameters for the Can Nm module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNm是AUTOSAR网络管理模块的配置项，用于定义控制器局域网络（CAN）网络管理策略，包括网络请求和释放机制，以及节点的唤醒和睡眠行为。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanNm时，需要确保其参数与网络的实际需求相匹配，例如网络唤醒和睡眠策略；CanNm配置应与其他网络管理模块（如ComM和Nm）协同工作，以保证网络管理的一致性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准可能引入了新的属性或者对旧属性有所调整，因此在配置时应参考最新的标准文档。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00087</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:5adfcc42-72f3-4b31-8817-31cc191594f8">
                  <SHORT-NAME>CanNmGlobalConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the global configuration parameter of the CanNm. The parameters and the parameters of the sub containers shall be mapped to the C data type CanNm_ConfigType (for parameters where it is possible) which is passed to the CanNm_Init function.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmGlobalConfig是用于配置CAN网络管理（CAN Network Management）全局参数的配置项，包括网络管理策略、消息周期等关键参数，以确保网络的稳定性和高效通信。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanNmGlobalConfig时，需要确保所选参数与网络的实际需求相匹配，避免因配置不当导致网络通信效率低下或不稳定；此外，AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中对于某些参数有明确的取值范围或条件限制，需要仔细遵守；最后，考虑到网络的可扩展性和兼容性，应当谨慎选择静态配置与动态配置的比例。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2f4ec8ee-6cab-47d2-a7cd-4a429eb7f8c9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmBusLoadReductionEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling busload reduction support.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmBusLoadReductionEnabled是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理（CAN NM）中的总线负载减少功能，以降低网络上的数据传输量。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要确保网络的带宽和性能要求得到满足；此功能的使用可能会影响到网络节点之间的通信效率和响应时间；在启用此功能前，应当评估网络的负载情况和各节点的通信需求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00040</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f27f1a40-1ef7-465f-b7a9-018baec90c72">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmBusSynchronizationEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling bus synchronization support. This feature is required for gateway nodes only.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmBusSynchronizationEnabled是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理（CAN NM）的总线同步功能，该功能允许节点在没有主节点的情况下同步到网络上的其他节点。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，需要确保网络中的其他节点也支持总线同步功能；如果网络配置不正确，可能会导致网络同步失败；此功能在某些特定的网络配置中可能不被支持，需参考具体的AUTOSAR CP版本和网络管理需求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00006</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:39e127e9-9bfb-4b66-91dc-69d319c5e033">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmComControlEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling the Communication Control support.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmComControlEnabled是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用网络管理（Network Management）通过CAN通信控制器的通信能力。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保在使用此配置项时考虑网络的需求和特定的应用场景；此配置项的启用或禁用会直接影响到网络节点的通信行为和性能；在配置时需确保与系统中其他网络管理配置项的兼容性和一致性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00013</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f245f7fe-a9db-4eea-b241-6f5dff772a63">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmComUserDataSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Preprocessor switch for enabling the Tx path of Com User Data.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmComUserDataSupport配置项用于指定网络管理是否支持通过CAN网络传输用户数据，这允许在网络管理消息中携带额外的用户数据。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在启用此功能时，需要确保网络带宽足以支持额外的用户数据传输，且不会影响网络管理消息的实时性和可靠性；此配置项的使用应与网络设计和需求紧密相关，确保网络的稳定性和性能；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应遵循相关的网络管理通信规范。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">Use case: Setting of NMUserData via SWC.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00044</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:88ba730b-a0ac-42c9-b182-bbda7da16a35">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmCoordinatorSyncSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables/disables the coordinator synchronization support.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmCoordinatorSyncSupport配置项用于指定网络管理协调器（Nm Coordinator）是否支持同步功能，这有助于在多个网络管理器之间同步状态和控制信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项对于实现跨多个网络通信的系统尤为重要；确保在设计阶段明确是否需要该同步功能，以便正确配置；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，对于网络管理的同步机制有明确的规范，需要遵循这些规范以保证系统的兼容性和稳定性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00080</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0c6b4279-9da7-411f-92da-bbe845f27408">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmDevErrorDetect是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理模块中的开发错误检测功能，这有助于在开发和测试阶段发现潜在的错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产代码中通常会禁用此功能以节省资源和避免不必要的性能开销；确保在开发和测试阶段根据需要启用此功能以进行适当的错误检测；在最终交付的产品中，应根据项目要求和优化策略来配置此参数。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cc0dd2dc-3056-4c50-bf07-c8c601188afe">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmGlobalPnSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling partial networking support globally.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmGlobalPnSupport是一个配置项，用于全局定义网络管理是否支持部分网络功能（Partial Networking），即是否允许网络管理模块控制ECU进入或退出低功耗模式。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用CanNmGlobalPnSupport时，需要确保所有网络节点都支持部分网络功能；如果部分网络未在整个网络中得到支持，则该配置可能不会生效；此配置项对于降低网络空闲时的能耗至关重要。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00086</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a84a2b93-549c-4eaf-a29b-8533d2dcce66">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmImmediateRestartEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling the immediate transmission of a NM PDU upon bus-communication request in Prepare-Bus-Sleep mode.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmImmediateRestartEnabled 是一个布尔配置参数，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理（CAN NM）中的立即重启功能，该功能允许在网络管理控制器检测到网络释放后立即重新加入网络。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需要确保它与系统的网络管理需求一致；如果启用，可能会影响网络的稳定性和带宽，因为节点可能会频繁地尝试重新加入网络；在禁用时，节点在网络释放后可能会有更长的延迟才能重新加入网络。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00009</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ede29802-8487-4471-ae68-0a530d246329">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmImmediateTxconfEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enable/disable the immediate tx confirmation.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmImmediateTxconfEnabled是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理中立即传输确认的功能，这有助于在需要快速响应的场景下提高通信效率。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在启用此功能时，需要确保网络的负载和带宽可以支持增加的传输频率；此配置可能会影响到网络的整体性能，特别是在高负载情况下；根据AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，确保与网络管理需求和策略相一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00041</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:89a4c7ef-a71f-4995-a457-3640bfc9e3c4">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmPassiveModeEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling support of the Passive Mode.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmPassiveModeEnabled 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理（CAN NM）的被动模式，这种模式下节点不会主动发送NM消息，但仍然能够接收和处理它们。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在被动模式下，节点不会参与网络管理的主动行为，如发送NM消息；这可能影响网络的管理和节点的唤醒能力；确保在不需要节点参与网络管理决策时使用此模式。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00010</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:abc8024d-f231-4568-a899-f6f8c8b257e3">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmPduRxIndicationEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Pre-processor switch for enabling the PDU Rx Indication.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmPduRxIndicationEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理接收PDU（协议数据单元）的指示功能，这决定了是否通知上层软件接收到新的PDU。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用此配置时，确保与网络管理需求相匹配；如果禁用，可能会影响网络管理的性能和功能；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应保持与网络管理策略的一致性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00011</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0f09a983-43cd-4aaa-b090-01143ba63f8c">
                      <SHORT-NAME>CanNmPnEiraCalcEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies if CanNm calculates the PN request information for internal an external requests. (EIRA)</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmPnEiraCalcEnabled 配置项用于启用或禁用对 EIRA（Extended Identifier Reception Allocation）的计算，这是网络管理中用于识别远程唤醒请求的功能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在使用部分网络管理功能时，确保此配置与系统需求一致；如果不需要远程唤醒功能，可以禁用以节省资源；AUTOSAR CP 4.4 标准中此配置应正确设置以保证网络管理的正确实现。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">true: PN request are calculated
                                        false: PN request are not calculated</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00070</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
