                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:cf0e90d1-c77e-42c9-a19e-5b3ee1c9aab8">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmTransmitCalloutFunc</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">If the CanNmTransmitCalloutFunc parameter exist the CanNm module shall call the configured callback function. (It is not needed to specify a service port to the CanNm service component.)</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmTransmitCalloutFunc是一个回调函数，由网络管理模块调用，用于处理CAN网络管理消息的发送请求。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该回调函数的实现符合CAN网络管理的要求；在实现时考虑消息发送的优先级和时序；该配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中应当与网络管理策略和配置一致，避免与其他网络管理回调函数冲突。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">If the CanNmTransmitCalloutFunc parameter does not exist the CanNm module shall use a none mode.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00027</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
