                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3735b6e1-55f5-4c70-a74a-412c49c0f38d">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmRepeatMsgIndEnabled</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Enable/disable the notification that a RepeatMessageRequest bit has been received.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmRepeatMsgIndEnabled配置项用于启用或禁用CAN网络管理中重复消息指示的功能，这允许节点在接收到重复的网络管理消息时采取特定行动。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的使用应根据项目的具体需求来决定；如果启用，需要确保网络管理的实现能正确处理重复消息的情况；不正确的配置可能会影响网络的稳定性和性能。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00089</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                        </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-ENUMERATION-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:fd955a85-f2c8-4eb4-a31d-fbb0561f5965">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmPduCbvPosition</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Defines the position of the control bit vector within the NM PDU.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmPduCbvPosition配置项用于定义控制位矢量（Control Bit Vector, CBV）在网络管理PDU（Protocol Data Unit）中的位置，这对于正确解析和构建NM消息至关重要。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置CanNmPduCbvPosition时，需要确保其值与实际CAN帧中CBV的位置相匹配；此外，该配置应与网络上其他节点的配置保持一致，以确保网络管理通信的互操作性；最后，如果使用的是某种特定的CAN网络管理协议，如ISO或者OSEK NM，应参考该协议规定的CBV位置。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">The value of the parameter represents the location of the Control Bit Vector in the NM PDU (CanNmPduByte0 means byte 0, CanNmPduByte1 means byte 1, CanNmPduOff means source node identifier is not part of the NM PDU)

                                                ImplementationType: CanNm_PduPositionType</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00026</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
