                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.02</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">65.535</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.001</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:be191aab-c6f6-4a39-903f-af940f5a0339">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmMsgCycleOffset</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Time offset in the periodic transmission node. It determines the start delay of the transmission. Specified in seconds.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmMsgCycleOffset是用于定义CAN网络管理消息发送的相对偏移时间，它指定了周期性消息发送的起始时间点，以确保消息在预定的时间窗口内发送。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值应小于CanNmMsgCycleTime以避免时间窗口溢出；在配置时需要考虑网络上其他节点的消息发送时间，以减少冲突和网络拥塞；在多节点系统中，应确保每个节点的CanNmMsgCycleOffset有所区分，以优化网络带宽利用率。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">65.535</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:21645185-ede2-413f-a98d-d2d27b5439f9">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmMsgCycleTime</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Period of a NM PDU in seconds. It determines the periodic rate in the &quot;periodic transmission mode with bus load reduction&quot; and is the basis for transmit scheduling in the &quot;periodic transmission mode without bus load reduction&quot;.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmMsgCycleTime定义了CAN网络管理消息的发送周期，即两次相同网络管理消息之间的时间间隔。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该值需要根据网络的带宽和系统的实时性要求谨慎设置；过短的周期可能导致网络拥塞，过长的周期可能影响网络管理的效率和响应速度；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置与网络管理需求一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.5</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">65.535</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.001</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e443262-a8d3-43b3-80c8-8e9cc95cc4e4">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmMsgReducedTime</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Node specific bus cycle time in the periodic transmission mode with bus load reduction. Specified in seconds.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmMsgReducedTime配置项用于定义在网络管理通信中，CAN网络消息的减少时间间隔，即在特定条件下减少发送网络管理消息的频率以降低网络负载。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值需要根据网络的实际负载和性能要求谨慎设置，以避免影响网络管理的效率和可靠性；在设置时应考虑到不同网络节点的处理能力和响应时间，确保网络稳定性；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，该配置项的具体数值范围和默认值可能有所不同，需要参考具体的标准文档。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00043</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DEFAULT-VALUE>0.05</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                          <MAX INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">65.535</MAX>
                          <MIN INTERVAL-TYPE="CLOSED">0.001</MIN>
                        </ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:b57d7962-6598-46c9-b891-cb6f28e306bc">
                          <SHORT-NAME>CanNmMsgTimeoutTime</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">When using Partial Network and this timeout is defined then CanNm monitors that a NM-PDU is transmitted successfully within this Transmission Timeout Time and provides an error notification otherwise.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：CanNmMsgTimeoutTime定义了网络管理消息在CAN网络上的超时时间，用于监控网络管理消息的接收，确保网络的稳定性和可靠性。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该参数的设置需要根据网络的实际情况和要求进行调整，以避免过于频繁的网络管理消息导致的网络拥堵或过于宽松导致的网络不稳定；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保该配置项与网络管理需求和其他相关配置项（如CanNmTimeoutTime）协调一致；不同的网络可能需要不同的超时时间设置。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanNm_00030</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
